      "writtenOn": "2025-04-02T14:49:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thread is started only if the global gonfig is enabled, and global config values for QOS are not run time configurable.\nSo once the QOS enabled in global config indicates QOS thread needs to be running state.",
